+- Private BCH/XMZ prototype: add explicitly reviewed BCH regtest funding relay and offline retained relay status.
+  A durable attempt prevents retransmission after an uncertain result; historical status remains available after quote expiry.
+  These helper commands do not enable live markets or add GUI broadcast controls.
 - GUI: Maker selection reviews the selected Bitcoin amount instead of the maker's maximum.
 - GUI: Support outbound connections to makers through libp2p circuit relays.
 
